          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 mb-1">Model = Force, NOT Capacity</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-steel-700 leading-relaxed">Same barrel → same weight per batch. 390 mm: ≤ 100 kg/batch (HN300–HN500 all same). 300 mm small barrel: ≤ 60 kg/batch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm">
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xl">💪</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">Pick by Seed Hardness</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-steel-700 leading-relaxed">Soft 300–400T; Medium 400–500T; Hard 600–630T. Bigger model only presses harder seeds more cleanly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm">
          <span class="shrink-0 text-xl">⚡</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">More Batches → Double-Barrel</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-steel-700 leading-relaxed">One presses while you load/unload the other. Removes idle time between batches — +30–50% more daily batches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
